<title>USA: Xircom says Intel acquires stake.</title>
<headline>Xircom says Intel acquires stake.</headline>
<dateline>THOUSAND OAKS, Calif. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xircom Inc on Thursday said in has signed an agreement under which Intel Corp will purchase 2.5 million Xircom shares, or 12.5 percent of its outstanding stock, and warrants to acquire an 1.5 million more shares, or an additional 7.5 percent.</p>
<p>The value of the initial deal is $52 million, Xircom said.</p>
<p>Xircom and Intel also signed a three-year technology and multi-million dollar original equipment manufacture (OEM) agreement under which they will work together on mobile connectivity products for high-performance business computing.</p>
<p>Xircom shares closed up 4-5/8 at 24-1/4.</p>
